OL,3,GNEWSAPolitical rivals join forces to
OL,4,Aclear footpath
OL,5,
OL,6,FO'Neil said: "As I've got to know
OL,7,F[Murphy and Sharp], they've gotten to
OL,8,Fsee that I'm a normal, respectable
OL,9,Fhuman being and someone that can work
OL,10,Falongside them on issues such as
OL,11,Fmaintaining things in the ward."
